Dependencies not vendored here
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The chaincode builds against hyperledger/fabric-contract-api-go and
hyperledger/fabric-chaincode-go (Apache-2.0). The anchoring contract is built
and tested with Hardhat (MIT). Neither is redistributed in this repository;
both are fetched by the respective package manager. See chaincode/obhoycc/go.sum
and anchor/package-lock.json for the exact versions.

